399 0 obj
<<
/A 1404 0 R
/Alt (Four line graphs labeled A to D show concentrations or rates of various metabolites or reactions over ninety-six hours for four doses of valproic acid \(zero, one hundred, one thousand, five thousand milligrams\), with each dose color-coded. Graph A plots val_cyt \(millimolar\) and shows pronounced peaks at higher doses. Graph B shows v_CPT1 \(millimolar per hour\), which decreases as dose increases, with moderate oscillations over time. Graph C plots c16_cyt \(ten to the minus five millimolar\) with noticeable fluctuations and higher peaks at increased doses. Graph D displays TAG_ld \(millimolar\); TAG_ld increases for one hundred milligram and one thousand milligrams relative to zero milligram, whereas five thousand milligram shows a decrease in TAG_ld. A legend indicates color coding for each dose.)
/K [76 1405 0 R]
/P 96 0 R
/Pg 40 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 2)
/Type /StructElem
>>
